        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Double Cylinder Mortise Locks for Storefront Doors, Solid Brass</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStorefront door double mortise (threaded) cylinder locks for Adams Rite style <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise Deadbolt</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\"><b>Mortise Deadlatch</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\"><b>Mortise Hookbolt</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso see: <a href=\"/collections/storefront-door-hardware\"><b>Store Door Hardware</b></a> for <a href=\"/products/1-inch-brass-mortise-cylinder-lock-for-storefront-door-th1100-bc\">Single Mortise Cylinder</a>,  <a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-security-guard\">Cylinder Security Guard</a>,  \r\n<a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-spacer-ring-glo-th1100-tr1\">Extruded Spacer Ring</a>, <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-cylinder-brass-thumbturn-th1100-bt\">Mortise Thumbturn</a> and related hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nDouble cylinder set includes Two (2) mortise cylinder locks keyed alike (same key operates both locks) and Two (2) keys. Double cylinder is a keyed lock on both the outside and inside of a door. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Double Cylinder Mortise Locks\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>(2) Keyed Mortise Cylinders (threaded to screw into mortise lock body)</li>\r\n<li>Key Cylinder 5-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>1\" Body Length</li>\r\n<li>Standard 1-5/32\" Diameter</li>\r\n<li>Adams Rite A/R Cam (MS Series Cam)</li>\r\n<li>Includes <a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-spacer-ring-glo-th1100-tr2\">3/16\" Stamped Trim Ring</a></li>\r\n<li> Solid Brass Cylinders</li>\r\n<li>Includes (2) Keys</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Available in aluminum or dark bronze finish.\r\n</p>",
